<HelloFraandsPage title="Rates, payouts & taxes" summary="Har minute ka hissa aur payout ka hisaab samjhein.">
<p>This is a preview of the proposed payout calculation. Paid calls and payouts are unavailable here. Final rates, tax treatment and payout terms must be published before hosting starts.</p>
<h2>How the planned platform share works</h2><p>For each paid minute, the specification proposes a platform share of ₹2 plus 40% of the amount above ₹2. It assumes 18% GST is included within that share; final tax treatment requires review.</p>
<h2>Example: a ₹5 minute</h2><ul><li>Amount above ₹2: ₹5 − ₹2 = ₹3.</li><li>40% of ₹3 = ₹1.20.</li><li>Platform share: ₹2 + ₹1.20 = ₹3.20, including GST.</li><li>Host share: ₹5 − ₹3.20 = ₹1.80, before any applicable TDS or host tax.</li></ul>
<h2>Planned UPI payouts</h2><p>The proposed service pays eligible host earnings weekly to a verified UPI account. The minimum payout, verification, dispute and withholding rules must be published before payouts begin.</p>
<h2>Taxes need final review</h2><p>PAN, TDS, GST treatment and the host earnings statement must be confirmed and disclosed before payouts launch. Tax obligations depend on each host's circumstances; seek independent tax advice if needed.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
